<title>USA: BOXING-ROMERO RETAINS IBF JR BANTAMWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-ROMERO RETAINS IBF JR BANTAMWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, New Mexico 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Danny Romero knocked out Jaji Sabali of South Africa at 2:34 of the sixth round to retain his International Boxing Federation junior bantamweight title on Saturday.</p>
</text>
